# VIEW_ENV profile: the TrueBones "main body" view (PZ deform-bone rule, user 2026-09-02) for per-rig LoRA and
# zero-shot arms. Rig-specific knobs stay on the command line: RIG, BATCH (must divide n_train: Buffalo 5,
# Gazelle 8, Dragon 5, Spider 13), LORA_R, EPOCHS, and the backbone (INIT + DIM/DEPTH/HEADS + DEMO_*) -- see
# configs/lora_backbone_*.env. CALIB must be the artifact measured for THIS rig, batch and demo condition.
KTJD_ROOT=${KTJD_ROOT:-dataset/ktjd17_truebones_lora_v2_mainbody}
PERCELL=${PERCELL:-data/tb_norm_stats_v2_mainbody.npz}
JOINT_SEM=${JOINT_SEM:-data/joint_semantics_llm2vec_ktjd17_v1_mainbody.npz}
